"For example, if you’re installing Qubes OS *from* a USB drive *onto* a USB "
"drive, they must be two distinct USB drives, and they must both be plugged "
"into your computer at the same time. (**Note:** This may not apply to "
"advanced users who partition their devices appropriately.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:202
#: 5ca5aeee69624bd78b4f0b5e9c8d1f65
msgid ""
