#: 8723a578bf184bc6a7405d0c07c261a6
msgid "Updating"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:332
#: 80e86ff6d0354a4dad0e54ad23d95a26
msgid ""
"Next, :doc:`update </user/how-to-guides/how-to-update>` your installation to "
