"the best ways to remain secure against new threats."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:335
#: 8aadb245aaaa4ac39c24735ff638777a
msgid "Security"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:338
#: 3b3f04a9ac204b2195f648422cbedc53
msgid ""
"The Qubes OS Project occasionally issues `Qubes Security Bulletins (QSBs) "
"<https://www.qubes-os.org/security/qsb/>`__ as part of the :doc:`Qubes "
"Security Pack (qubes-secpack) </project-security/security-pack>`. It is "
"important to make sure that you receive all QSBs in a timely manner so that "
"you can take action to keep your system secure. (While :ref:`user/"
"downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide:updating` will handle "
"most security needs, there may be cases in which additional action from you "
"is required.) For this reason, we strongly recommend that every Qubes user "
"subscribe to the :ref:`qubes-announce <introduction/support:qubes-announce>` "
"mailing list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:340
#: 27189add3ae94d5d85e820f32fbcbcbd
msgid ""
"In addition to QSBs, the Qubes OS Project also publishes `Canaries <https://"
"www.qubes-os.org/security/canary/>`__, XSA summaries, :term:`templates "
"<template>` releases and end-of-life notices, and other items of interest to "
"Qubes users. Since these are not essential for all Qubes users to read, they "
"are not sent to :ref:`qubes-announce <introduction/support:qubes-announce>` "
"in order to keep the volume on that list low. However, we expect that most "
"users, especially novice users, will find them helpful. If you are "
"interested in these additional items, we encourage you to subscribe to the "
"`Qubes News RSS feed <https://www.qubes-os.org/feed.xml>`__ or join one of "
"our other :doc:`venues </introduction/support>`, where these news items are "
"also announced."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:342
#: 02281bfefc114d2090a40e009ecb8406
msgid ""
"For more information about Qubes OS Project security, please see the :doc:"
"`security center </project-security/security>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:345
#: 874a06b9fa214d2495ed02a91f0450fe
msgid "Backups"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:348
#: 9674772de45345458fa753626fec0db7
msgid ""
"It is extremely important to make regular backups so that you don’t lose "
"your data unexpectedly. The :doc:`Qubes backup system </user/how-to-guides/"
"how-to-back-up-restore-and-migrate>` allows you to do this securely and "
"easily."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:351
#: e04b6ff6b3bd4599a8f5839c14b32c97
msgid "Submit your HCL report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:354
#: e7d95fcfc3874908a51d6c3d6556e179
msgid ""
"Consider giving back to the Qubes community and helping other users by :ref:"
"`generating and submitting a Hardware Compatibility List (HCL) report <user/"
